Cell["\<\
There is now one nondegenerate band, with labels Gamma_1(1), K_1(1), and \
A_1(1). Both examples use zero onsite energy, but the spinor and scalar bases \
give double-valued and single-valued corepresentations, respectively.\
\>", "TechNoteText",ExpressionUUID->"0010c80f-4afa-4448-9933-cade139ae701"]
}, Open  ]],

